@{
    // Sets the browser tab title for the Settings page.
    ViewData["Title"] = "Settings";
}

<section class="about-hero">
    <p class="about-tag">System Settings</p>
    <h1>Student Budget Tracking System</h1>
    <p class="about-intro">
        The settings page serves as a simple information area for future customization features of the system.
        It reminds users that the project is designed to help students manage their allowance, monitor expenses,
        and maintain better budgeting habits.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-card">
        <h2>Current Setup</h2>
        <p>
            The system currently uses session-based login, in-memory budget storage, and a responsive user
            interface. These settings are enough for prototype use, demonstrations, and academic presentation.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
        <h2>Future Options</h2>
        <p>
            In future versions, this page may include account preferences, password updates, export settings,
            notification controls, and personal budgeting targets for each user.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
        <h2>Project Reminder</h2>
        <p>
            This capstone system was created to promote financial awareness and responsible spending among
            students by making daily budgeting more organized, accessible, and easier to understand.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
